    "body": "Stopped before claiming. Required prerequisites #2160, #2161, and #2166 are not implemented on upstream/main 6349a542e7560510a830bfb5521cefdd13e6b2e6.\n\n#2160 is open and blocked. #2161 and #2166 are open. The current commands/mod.rs exports no nest commands. The current source tree has no automatic nesting backend. No open PR references these three prerequisites, so there is no prerequisite PR to stack on.\n\n#2165 requires the MCP handlers to call those undoable commands through History and to exercise the complete nest-to-post flow. Implementing the missing backend here would duplicate the prerequisite issues and exceed this issue's scope.\n\nProspective files: crates/app/src/mcp/{mod,tools,job,nest_tools}.rs, crates/app/tests/mcp_nest.rs, .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md, and docs/decisions/2165-nesting-mcp.md. File-level overlap checks found #2253, #2149, #2134, #2100, #2092, and #2089. Function-level overlap assessment remains pending until the prerequisite APIs exist.\n\nNo claim, branch, worktree, code change, pin, gate run, or PR was created. Resume after the prerequisites land or have an eligible base to stack on.\n",
